      "content": {
        "text": "Preview the ICANN FY27\u201331 Operating and Financial Plans\nICANN has thoroughly considered the community's feedback on the Operating and Financial Plans for fiscal years 2027\u20132031 (FY27\u201331). ICANN will publish the updated plans on the Public Comment proceeding page ahead of consideration by the ICANN Board. ICANN is also holding an informational webinar on 23 April to present the community's input and the updated plans. Click the title to learn more.",
        "placeholder": null,
        "value": null,
        "name": ""
      },
      "href": "https://www.icann.org/en/announcements/details/preview-the-icann-fy2731-operating-and-financial-plans-06-04-2026-en",
      "descriptive_label": "general_link: Preview the ICANN FY27\u201331 O..."
    },
